Solutions to all three questions of the <Introduction to schemes course of the University of Oxford>, Part C, sat on 8 June 2023. Source: https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/request_for_mathematics_examinat/response/3129786/attach/3/FOI%20202507%20740%20Data.pdf#page=346[Oxford's released examination PDF, compilation pages 346–348; paper pages 1–3]. The original numeric, letter and Roman labels are retained. The compactness hypotheses in the <valuative criterion> and the interpretation of the removed section in 3(e) are made explicit below.

